                        "description": "The following data is from the example data in the linked metadata and can be copy\/pasted into any Jinja Editor to help build your script.\n\n```\n{{vars.example_data\n  |toJSON\n  |regex_replace(\"^\\\"\",\"\")\n  |regex_replace(\"\\\"$\",\"\")\n  |replace(\"\\\\\",\"\")\n}}\n```\n\nThen your Jinja Script can leverage the metadata above like in the below example:\n\n```\n{%- raw %}\nconfig\n  edit {{ data.datakey.config1 }}\n    set edit {{ data.datakey.config1.setting }}\n  next\nend\n{%- endraw %}\n```",
